language design-core version 0.5.
unit ActionEmitter.
interface ActionSourcePort.
actor ApplicationDeveloper.
functionality EmitActionConstructors.
activity ExistingCapability.
usecase GenerateModelConstructors.
mode Generating.
container GenerationCommandProcess.
unit GenerationPublisher.
activity IndependentPackaging.
feature ModelGeneration.
interface OwnedOutputPort.
functionality PublishOwnedGeneration.
capability ReproducibleGoConstructors.
functionality RequestUiConstructors.
interface SduiCodeGenerationPort.
unit UiGenerationAdapter.
ActionEmitter consumes ActionSourcePort.
ActionEmitter owns EmitActionConstructors.
ApplicationDeveloper pursues GenerateModelConstructors.
EmitActionConstructors allocated-to GenerationCommandProcess in mode Generating.
EmitActionConstructors contributes-to ModelGeneration.
EmitActionConstructors realizes ReproducibleGoConstructors.
ExistingCapability addresses EmitActionConstructors.
ExistingCapability addresses PublishOwnedGeneration.
ExistingCapability addresses RequestUiConstructors.
ExistingCapability delivers ModelGeneration.
ExistingCapability has implementation-status = implemented.
GenerationCommandProcess contains ActionEmitter.
GenerationCommandProcess contains GenerationPublisher.
GenerationCommandProcess contains UiGenerationAdapter.
GenerationCommandProcess provides ReproducibleGoConstructors.
GenerationPublisher consumes OwnedOutputPort.
GenerationPublisher owns PublishOwnedGeneration.
IndependentPackaging has implementation-status = planned.
ModelGeneration supports GenerateModelConstructors.
PublishOwnedGeneration allocated-to GenerationCommandProcess in mode Generating.
PublishOwnedGeneration contributes-to ModelGeneration.
PublishOwnedGeneration realizes ReproducibleGoConstructors.
ReproducibleGoConstructors requires ActionSourcePort in mode Generating.
ReproducibleGoConstructors requires OwnedOutputPort in mode Generating.
ReproducibleGoConstructors requires SduiCodeGenerationPort in mode Generating.
RequestUiConstructors allocated-to GenerationCommandProcess in mode Generating.
RequestUiConstructors contributes-to ModelGeneration.
RequestUiConstructors realizes ReproducibleGoConstructors.
UiGenerationAdapter consumes SduiCodeGenerationPort.
UiGenerationAdapter owns RequestUiConstructors.
